--- text
Your payment receipt

We charged [CURRENCY] [TOTAL] to your [CARD_BRAND] ending
[CARD_LAST4] on [INVOICE_DATE]. Your [PLAN_NAME] plan is paid
through [BILLING_PERIOD].

This email is your receipt. Keep it for your records, or for a tax
or expense claim.

Receipt details

Invoice number: [INVOICE_NUMBER]
Date: [INVOICE_DATE]
Billing period: [BILLING_PERIOD]
Payment method: [CARD_BRAND] ending [CARD_LAST4]

Items on invoice [INVOICE_NUMBER]

Item: [PLAN_NAME]
[BILLING_PERIOD]
Qty: [SEAT_COUNT]
Amount: [CURRENCY] [AMOUNT]

Invoice totals

Subtotal: [CURRENCY] [SUBTOTAL]
Tax: [CURRENCY] [TAX]
Total paid: [CURRENCY] [TOTAL]

Download invoice:

[SECONDARY_URL]

This plan renews automatically. The next charge falls due on
[NEXT_CHARGE_DATE], to the same card, unless you cancel before that
date.

If a line on this receipt does not look right, reply to this email,
or write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
